    D -- binary --> E[BOOLEAN <br> <a href='https://github.com/mabablue/I-ADOPT-patterns-playground/blob/main/pattern/VDP103.yaml'>VDP103</a><br>]
    D -- nominal -->F[NOMINAL <br> <a href='https://github.com/mabablue/I-ADOPT-patterns-playground/blob/main/pattern/VDP101.yaml'>VDP101</a><br>]
    E -- ordinal -->G[ORDINAL <br> <a href='https://github.com/mabablue/I-ADOPT-patterns-playground/blob/main/pattern/VDP102.yaml'>VDP102</a><br>]
    C -- quantitative -->H{Which quantitative scale applies?}:::white
    H -- integer -->I[COUNT <br> <a href='https://github.com/mabablue/I-ADOPT-patterns-playground/blob/main/pattern/VDP104.yaml'>VDP104</a><br>]
    H -- time-instant -->K[INSTANT <br> <a href='https://github.com/mabablue/I-ADOPT-patterns-playground/blob/main/pattern/VDP137.yaml'>VDP137</a><br>]
    H -- interval-points -->L[INTERVAL <br> <a href='https://github.com/mabablue/I-ADOPT-patterns-playground/blob/main/pattern/VDP105.yaml'>VDP105</a><br>]
